lourful&amp;dark hand-drawn pictures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ interactions leading you to think about life, each in different way</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies will attack YOU. They don\u2019t care about character your're playing as</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 unlockable skins</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack composed by ArcaneOwl</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1508220/extras/2754142937381dfed98e386d74efc132.poster.avif?t=1731443117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1508220/extras/2754142937381dfed98e386d74efc132.webm?t=1731443117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">                                                                                                                      C\u0338\u033f\u0340\u031d\u0319a\u0335\u0360\u0342\u034d\u031en\u0336\u0310\u0301\u0349\u0345'\u0334\u0301\u0321\u032at\u0334\u0307\u032c \u0334\u0306\u035b\u032b\u0330w\u0337\u0308\u0302\u0319\u031fa\u0337\u0312\u0356i\u0335\u030c\u033d\u0322t\u0338\u034c\u035d\u0328 \u0334\u0342\u0312\u032at\u0338\u035d\u0312\u0345\u034eo\u0336\u0311\u0343\u035a \u0335\u0346\u0313\u0349m\u0335\u034c\u0307\u033ae\u0336\u0300\u0346\u0348e\u0334\u035d\u0341\u0353\u032dt\u0334\u0350\u0344\u0347 \u0335\u0352\u0357\u032f\u0332y\u0336\u0352\u031d\u0325o\u0335\u033d\u0329u\u0336\u035d\u0325</p>",
